{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0847334fcc62e8507c67d76417be7252b60fa085c5ee10aa01b4da9498d58c19", "ja": "（明日は劇場で、まつりの初ライブがある。\n準備も終わったし、そろそろ帰ろう）", "zh": "（明天将在剧场举办茉莉的首次演唱会。\n一切都准备就绪了，我就先回家吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4da4c9babe1d0c9868a1c7e237cd4035587de326064d70edaab90eefc7681790", "ja": "（あれ？　レッスンルームにまだ灯りが点いてる……。\n誰か残ってるのか？）", "zh": "（奇怪？练习室的灯还亮着……\n有人还留着吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d50298e7afcc534e1de8bb64912a528601e7594b867931e7f1b3dbd7bdd703b", "ja": "わん、つー！\nわん、つー！", "zh": "1、2！\n1、2！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "119a98b3534c632b62825f34a11045de2ae81fa64a5e2e15bc41568aed1c25e3", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nもう少しステップを速くした方がいいかな？", "zh": "呼、呼……\n舞步是不是该再加快一点啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "ddad71375534463fcd6483f947f0499b890451efe48a0b523af7c65662558fa2", "ja": "もう1回、なのです！\nせーの、", "zh": "再来一次的喔！\n预备──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "269873d2e4a2dce1159d654fa1ea7c9e88f083be3e0bc589d34da17986605894", "ja": "まつり？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "139bd47a2d9d1102363676ea12cc54e77cf38566f5b4fca8de88182890c21922", "ja": "！？　{$P$}さん……。\nまつりに、何かご用なのです？", "zh": "！？\n{$P$}先生……你找茉莉有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9e56b9e62e3f76b4b4844c8d0334d7dc64e93d8587342e667efe8a9f89100aa4", "ja": "いや、レッスンルームに灯りがついていたから、\n様子を見に来たんだけど。まつりは、居残り練習か？", "zh": "不，因为练习室的灯亮着，我才来看看。\n茉莉，你留下来练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "03d20ba33fb9e4add81ac1524f3ed2ba137873b6119423838191798c4a3f21a6", "ja": "ほ？　居残り練習？\n何のことなのです？？", "zh": "哦？留下来练习？\n你在说什么的呀？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0357633502f22b7024c6da72ecc08573ad1a3f122efdb3ffc255bf4b707d3f14", "ja": "え？　でも、今……。", "zh": "咦？不过，你刚才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "8d050439f01e00e50b53c9a71fc65c730c68a0c08f3723198223cbec6726c217", "ja": "まつりはただ、\n妖精さんとお話していただけなのです。", "zh": "茉莉刚才，\n只是在跟妖精说话的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ac7e7a06b4bb440f9ced9320d1412b5caefd09be83fd2f8ecd88515f8500608b", "ja": "妖精さん？", "zh": "妖精？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "c3d86b2522043cf957b42d9cc8ab94d2550105384438fab3ed50d9ef2c493e37", "ja": "はいなのです。妖精さんは恥ずかしがり屋さんなので、\n夜にならないと出てきてくれないのです。", "zh": "没错的喔。因为妖精很害羞，\n只会在晚上出现的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "12494d3a48ef293820863988fb41024a19d3c59c37d5225de72fb0b55d85fd45", "ja": "だから、暗くなるまで待っていたのですよ。", "zh": "所以茉莉才会等到天色变暗的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d0f2e21e81a2290e85a159e0f55523b07acbe85e64275f70957f421bb5fa6bf3", "ja": "じゃあ、きっと俺が声を掛けたせいで、\nまた隠れちゃったんだな？", "zh": "那么，一定是因为我出声了，\n妖精才又躲起来对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "122eb4cf6b12ee66baed259eb0c810472b002a6981c5c4360143fe64b07f7466", "ja": "そうなのです！　{$P$}さんも、\nこれからは気をつけるのですよ？", "zh": "没错的喔！{$P$}先生，\n你以后也要好好注意的唷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5a397108ba079d326862ee3fbac2ab16a63cd5ab729786cdcd289cdb7421d0ec", "ja": "わかったよ。……ところでまつり、\n明日はいよいよライブ本番だな！", "zh": "我知道了……话说茉莉啊，\n明天就是正式演唱会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "8802fd125456a8caab3c01034c1a6ad346fb785026357f2cec4135ce46519496", "ja": "はいほー！　やっとファンのみなさんに\n姫のステージをお披露目できるのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho！终于可以在粉丝们面前\n展现公主的表演了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "0fd9a6315a521ef1de4794fab003ed4d831cd32536e58fe88f5d20a2a76f1e00", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、見逃し厳禁なのです。\n……ね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生也不能错过的喔。\n……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8f773bed3147879c1d75005765e1863701512db63384d7e863aa4485bb74d252", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n明日はファンのみんなを、全力で楽しませよう！", "zh": "嗯，那当然。\n明天就使出全力，让粉丝们好好享受表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "没错的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "407d901c61c516fb61b71bb30f8c6e4ee0fa1d5204a9a0ad47c2b076da50ff42", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、ファンのみんなも、\nまとめてまつり姫のお城にご招待、なのですー！", "zh": "茉莉会把{$P$}先生和粉丝们\n一起邀来茉莉公主的城堡的喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "29e8e00bde21e27483a28e08fd95a78ef95cc3093ae7aef6157f44d10e2b0da2", "ja": "頼もしいな。なら、明日全力でライブできるように、\n今日はもう帰ったほうがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "真是可靠呢。那为了明天能在演唱会上发挥全力，\n你今天也该回家了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "742f02119f919325a8a08ff7c62bffc88ed7f2638450c9a9a5cf457d29975312", "ja": "むう……わかったのです。", "zh": "唔……明白了唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "3ee520b106a8ce068fc008e895953cbff32b68abd71a3b80d648a2f54a1d06d2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\n妖精さんも、バイバイなのですー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了喔。\n妖精也掰掰的唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_021mat_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a2da9282c74d6cea41dc4df9f3277a299b2cdd6f4020947070f0f4f6e4757672", "ja": "（……ずいぶん頑張り屋の妖精さんがいるらしい。\n俺も自信をもって、ステージに送り出せそうだ！）", "zh": "（……这里似乎有个很努力的妖精呢。\n看来我也能信心十足地把她送上舞台了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
